        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIMLqUm3Qqp8Nm6QxvkVfu1f1ftyvMpEJjTuED8dIbm4ERnCg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Ian and his crew did an incredible job. He was meticulous in the placement of our pool fence, ensuring it was both perfectly functional as well as beautiful in our back yard. After as quick training session once the fence was installed, I have been able to take down and put the fence back up in minutes while keeping my young child safe 100% of the time.\n\nIf you are installing a pool fence, this is the company you should use!",
        "time": 1628088974,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Franco Sanzari",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105069000255661462443/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ_YhTdMy6LTKDaeJjBqUw4Ug42WjymEYGKortyHRLKiT_Geg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Professionals from start to finish. They were quick in responding with an estimate , as well as scheduling an appointment with us (which they kept). They took the time to explain the fence setup and how to remove it. Easy to deal with and headache free. We highly recommend them for their professionalism, pricing, and quality.",
        "time": 1664745054,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Marie France Auger",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102484866299519143363/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVvKKgCTPegPiYKIDBFo_-sDPWMZKDo93awu6W0uoe1uqtjF5JeBw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Professional work. Good customer communication.\n\nI'm really satisfied with the result! Even the most reluctant members of my family and friends liked the product; this fence doesn't obstruct the view at all, and our view of the pool remains unobstructed. The removable panels are a much-appreciated feature!",
        "time": 1685195023,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Marlène M",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100922635540385181524/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKAFW4S_f3jPBFAxNuh2UwlOnMT25NxFwfru-rdmIVv_ejVig=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Superior quality product with a beautiful finish. Professional installation service with great attention to detail. The installer was very dedicated and available, and the end result is absolutely perfect! We are more than satisfied, and our children are safe!",
        "time": 1588516443,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jonathan Plouffe",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101303092854149149806/reviews",
